<title>USA: Amrion sees meeting 1996 estimates.</title>
<headline>Amrion sees meeting 1996 estimates.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amrion Inc, which manufactures nutriceuticals and nutritional supplements, said Thursday it expects to meet analysts' sales and earnings estimates for 1996.</p>
<p>On a consensus basis, analysts expect the company to earn $0.81 a share for the year, compared to $0.60 last year, according to First Call.</p>
<p>Amrion was not available to provide sales estimates.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
